WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.300 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 15]

01:43.560 --> 01:44.290
Happy New Year's Eve.

02:01.200 --> 02:02.100
Wake up. Time to eat.

02:20.470 --> 02:22.260
It's thin porridge and pickles every day.

02:22.960 --> 02:23.940
Can we have something else for once?

02:25.120 --> 02:26.170
What do you want then?

02:29.030 --> 02:30.060
Fried tofu puffs.

02:31.630 --> 02:32.660
Tofu puffs?

02:33.080 --> 02:34.410
You think you're an honored guest?

02:35.030 --> 02:36.410
You're a prisoner!

02:37.400 --> 02:38.290
Tofu puffs?

02:39.550 --> 02:41.300
What, the kind stuffed with meat, too?

02:50.480 --> 02:51.900
This corn bun is hard as a rock.

02:52.510 --> 02:53.210
Sect Leader Yi

02:53.230 --> 02:54.580
wants to negotiate with him,

02:55.320 --> 02:56.580
yet serves this kind of meal?

02:57.080 --> 02:57.740
Sect Leader

02:57.780 --> 02:58.900
gave no such order.

02:59.320 --> 03:00.490
But a prisoner here

03:00.560 --> 03:01.900
always eats like this.

03:06.550 --> 03:06.860
Go.

03:07.600 --> 03:08.970
Prepare tofu puffs for Mr. Su,

03:10.440 --> 03:11.770
the kind stuffed with meat.

03:12.990 --> 03:14.180
Anything else, Mr. Su?

03:15.440 --> 03:17.370
A bowl of hot rice will do.

03:22.110 --> 03:22.460
Go.

03:23.110 --> 03:23.620
Got it.

03:43.760 --> 03:44.370
How is it?

03:46.950 --> 03:47.420
My lord,

03:48.110 --> 03:49.690
he's still trapped by the Drunken Dream Bone,

03:50.230 --> 03:51.250
no change at all.

03:51.600 --> 03:52.970
Then report back.

03:53.670 --> 03:54.320
Sect Leader

03:54.320 --> 03:55.620
is cautious indeed.

03:56.270 --> 03:58.020
He sends checks every single day.

03:58.640 --> 03:59.140
Got it.

04:07.030 --> 04:08.770
I came to tell you something.

04:09.670 --> 04:10.650
Yi Bu is using your life

04:10.650 --> 04:11.840
to force Su Changhe

04:12.320 --> 04:13.450
to assassinate the Prince of Langya.

04:14.600 --> 04:15.570
He agreed.

04:18.750 --> 04:19.620
Has he made his move?

04:21.270 --> 04:22.210
Seems this

04:22.210 --> 04:23.690
doesn't surprise you.

04:24.310 --> 04:26.100
Changhe likes doing crazy things.

04:26.950 --> 04:28.740
And going after the Prince of Langya

04:29.120 --> 04:30.250
is crazy enough.

04:31.800 --> 04:32.490
I believe

04:32.950 --> 04:34.300
the moment he drew his blade,

04:35.560 --> 04:36.930
whatever his reason,

04:37.720 --> 04:38.890
he'd feel the rush.

04:40.070 --> 04:40.860
But...

04:43.000 --> 04:44.180
he must have failed.

04:46.870 --> 04:47.980
Why do you say that?

04:48.510 --> 04:49.540
If he'd succeeded,

04:50.800 --> 04:52.180
shouldn't I be out by now?

04:54.600 --> 04:55.330
Fair point.

04:55.800 --> 04:57.370
The attempt failed.

04:58.120 --> 05:00.060
Su Changhe seems badly hurt.

05:00.830 --> 05:01.450
But...

05:02.390 --> 05:03.420
using that as a pretext,

05:03.870 --> 05:04.740
he asked Yi Bu

05:05.070 --> 05:07.420
to let more of Blood River's elite killers

05:08.310 --> 05:09.860
into Tianqi City.

05:16.420 --> 05:18.680
[Flying Tiger General's Residence]

05:18.680 --> 05:19.250
Uncle,

05:20.600 --> 05:22.570
do you know what a desperado is?

05:23.040 --> 05:23.810
Someone

05:24.720 --> 05:26.570
will do anything with no fear of death.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.660
A true desperado

05:30.190 --> 05:31.660
likes to throw himself

05:32.240 --> 05:33.890
into the deadliest spots,

05:34.800 --> 05:37.370
then claw his way out.

05:38.800 --> 05:39.980
Do you mean

05:41.270 --> 05:42.220
the Patriarch of Blood River,

05:42.220 --> 05:43.620
the one Li Xinyue

05:43.950 --> 05:45.100
nearly killed?

05:48.510 --> 05:49.780
The desperado

05:50.630 --> 05:52.250
has already jumped into the game.

05:53.310 --> 05:54.690
Next comes...

05:58.270 --> 06:00.450
cards on the table.

06:07.920 --> 06:08.740
Has that list

06:09.040 --> 06:10.450
been sent to Uncle Qidao?

06:11.160 --> 06:11.930
It's been delivered.

06:12.270 --> 06:13.330
At Uncle Qidao's pace,

06:13.630 --> 06:14.550
those people

06:14.560 --> 06:15.620
are already on their way.

06:16.750 --> 06:17.860
I saw the list.

06:18.160 --> 06:18.780
Sir,

06:19.510 --> 06:20.370
you're ruthless.

06:22.040 --> 06:22.690
How so?

06:23.430 --> 06:24.890
I looked it over and over.

06:25.000 --> 06:25.930
On that list,

06:26.000 --> 06:27.220
the selection criteria

06:27.390 --> 06:28.180
came down to one thing:

06:28.680 --> 06:29.420
namely,

06:29.750 --> 06:31.010
who's the deadliest

06:31.390 --> 06:32.010
gets picked.

06:33.950 --> 06:35.570
Isn't that Blood River's creed from day one?

06:36.430 --> 06:37.060
Still,

06:38.000 --> 06:39.810
I think I've found an old friend.

06:40.680 --> 06:42.490
He's our sharpest blade.

06:44.190 --> 06:45.180
You mean...

06:50.870 --> 06:51.370
Who came in?

06:53.270 --> 06:53.930
Mu Ciling!

06:55.510 --> 06:56.300
That's me.

06:57.190 --> 06:59.370
Quit screaming like you've seen a ghost!

07:01.480 --> 07:02.740
Or I'll kill you.

07:04.830 --> 07:05.890
You're finally here.

07:08.870 --> 07:10.450
You knew I'd come for you?

07:11.040 --> 07:11.890
Su Muyu said

07:12.270 --> 07:13.720
after you left Jiuxiao City,

07:13.720 --> 07:14.740
he sent people to look for you

07:14.920 --> 07:16.010
and even sent you a letter.

07:16.630 --> 07:17.370
He says

07:18.430 --> 07:20.490
he can cure my Heart-Piercing Poison.

07:20.950 --> 07:21.620
True.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.690
He was hit with the former Patriarch's Life-Death Contract,

07:25.270 --> 07:26.300
and broke it himself.

07:26.630 --> 07:27.490
How?

07:29.560 --> 07:31.220
We'll know after we get him out.

07:38.480 --> 07:39.890
You cunning guy!

07:40.800 --> 07:41.450
All right,

07:42.270 --> 07:43.010
what do you need from me?

07:43.480 --> 07:44.360
On the day we move,

07:44.360 --> 07:45.810
Su Muyu and I need to be elsewhere.

07:46.480 --> 07:46.930
And you

07:47.430 --> 07:49.490
will hold off some troublesome types.

07:53.190 --> 07:54.450
Just stall them?

07:56.160 --> 07:57.300
No killing?

07:59.430 --> 08:00.930
If they won't back off,

08:00.950 --> 08:01.780
kill them all.

08:05.500 --> 08:08.860
[Phoenix Tide Inn]

08:20.390 --> 08:20.930
You're here.

08:22.800 --> 08:23.980
Forgive me! Forgive me!

08:27.870 --> 08:29.180
You're the family head now.

08:29.390 --> 08:30.420
Try to act the part.

08:37.670 --> 08:38.210
Xuewei.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.180
Yumo.

08:39.870 --> 08:40.690
Long time no see.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.330
Where's Muyu?

08:44.960 --> 08:45.690
Why isn't he here?

08:49.670 --> 08:50.180
Yeah.

08:50.750 --> 08:51.380
Where's Muyu?

08:53.630 --> 08:54.330
Strange.

08:55.870 --> 08:57.420
I just ran into three from the Su family.

08:57.630 --> 08:58.500
They asked me

08:58.670 --> 08:59.730
why Su Muyu didn't come.

08:59.910 --> 09:01.210
Now I see my own folks,

09:01.360 --> 09:02.330
and you're also asking me

09:02.600 --> 09:03.500
why Su Muyu didn't come,

09:03.510 --> 09:04.540
why didn't Su Muyu come.

09:05.200 --> 09:06.540
Then why didn't Muyu come?

09:07.910 --> 09:08.810
Because he was caught.

09:09.240 --> 09:09.780
Right now,

09:09.790 --> 09:11.330
he's locked up in the Shadow Sect's dungeon.

09:12.080 --> 09:12.660
What?

09:14.120 --> 09:15.450
Muyu's that strong.

09:15.870 --> 09:17.090
How could the Shadow Sect seize him?

09:18.720 --> 09:19.930
This is Tianqi City,

09:20.240 --> 09:21.260
their turf.

09:23.120 --> 09:24.260
Then where's the Shadow Sect?

09:30.080 --> 09:31.420
If I were the one captured,

09:32.440 --> 09:33.060
what would you do?

09:34.480 --> 09:35.330
We'd take our time and plan.

09:36.910 --> 09:38.500
Then since it's Su Muyu who's captured,

09:38.840 --> 09:39.610
what will you do?

09:43.440 --> 09:44.260
No time to waste.

09:51.670 --> 09:52.930
I'm crying.

09:57.150 --> 09:58.730
That's not what we meant.

09:59.390 --> 10:00.570
We just...

10:00.710 --> 10:01.810
I was faking.

10:07.790 --> 10:09.540
So when do we head out to rescue Muyu?

10:10.510 --> 10:11.180
Don't rush.

10:11.510 --> 10:13.850
Su Muyu's in the Shadow Prison for now.

10:14.000 --> 10:15.090
He's in no immediate danger.

10:16.360 --> 10:17.300
When the time is right,

10:17.630 --> 10:18.900
you'll get your chance to fight.

10:19.440 --> 10:20.020
For now,

10:20.270 --> 10:20.970
just stay here

10:21.120 --> 10:21.970
and wait for my signal.

10:22.360 --> 10:23.570
What's the Patriarch's take?

10:24.510 --> 10:25.500
What I'm saying

10:25.670 --> 10:27.020
is exactly the Patriarch's will.

10:27.360 --> 10:28.700
He hasn't assigned

10:28.700 --> 10:29.380
any task to you.

10:29.790 --> 10:30.420
Only this:

10:31.360 --> 10:32.930
You all slipped into the city under cover,

10:33.870 --> 10:35.140
so keep it that way.

10:35.390 --> 10:36.260
Don't let anyone

10:36.260 --> 10:37.210
spot you.

10:40.030 --> 10:40.610
Also,

10:41.630 --> 10:42.570
when you go out,

10:43.000 --> 10:44.180
remember your veil.

10:44.550 --> 10:45.420
Otherwise...

10:47.480 --> 10:48.500
you'll blow your cover too easily.

10:48.720 --> 10:49.330
Got it.

10:50.600 --> 10:52.090
How's the matter

10:52.150 --> 10:53.090
I asked you to check?

10:57.910 --> 10:59.800
The Xuanwu Guardian still hasn't returned.

10:59.960 --> 11:00.810
You likely

11:01.120 --> 11:02.420
won't see him this trip.

11:06.320 --> 11:06.900
I'm off now.

11:11.910 --> 11:13.020
Cold as ever.

11:21.320 --> 11:22.180
Oh...

11:23.320 --> 11:24.330
Had I known,

11:24.870 --> 11:26.020
I wouldn't have come.

11:28.150 --> 11:28.780
Everyone,

11:29.750 --> 11:31.450
today's topic

11:31.550 --> 11:34.090
is the founding emperor, Xiao Yi.

11:34.150 --> 11:37.300
- Great! - Great!

11:38.270 --> 11:40.380
He's eight chi tall,

11:40.670 --> 11:43.020
bold and fearless.

11:44.200 --> 11:46.210
He trained from age five,

11:46.480 --> 11:49.780
with a booklet bought for three coppers...

11:50.000 --> 11:50.570
Uncle Qidao!

11:52.510 --> 11:53.380
Oh, you're here.

11:53.960 --> 11:54.450
Have a seat.

12:01.200 --> 12:01.850
Uncle Qidao,

12:03.000 --> 12:04.300
did you move

12:05.000 --> 12:06.330
the whole Xie family here?

12:09.150 --> 12:10.610
It's the imperial capital.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.780
Men like us

12:13.550 --> 12:14.570
only get one chance in life

12:14.910 --> 12:16.570
to visit a place like this.

12:16.870 --> 12:18.420
So I brought them to broaden their horizons.

12:21.840 --> 12:22.780
That may be unwise.

12:27.910 --> 12:28.610
Relax.

12:29.000 --> 12:30.660
I borrowed someone else's identity.

12:30.910 --> 12:31.660
For now,

12:31.910 --> 12:33.450
we're the Five Tigers Sect.

12:33.960 --> 12:34.870
We're here

12:34.870 --> 12:36.500
to join the martial tournament.

12:36.670 --> 12:38.300
No one will question us.

12:39.120 --> 12:40.780
Blood River sent Su Zhe and Xie Qidao,

12:41.440 --> 12:43.300
with eighteen elite killers.

12:44.910 --> 12:46.210
Only twenty men

12:46.630 --> 12:48.060
to kill the Prince of Langya...

12:48.550 --> 12:49.900
nowhere near enough.

12:50.240 --> 12:51.690
Su Changhe also sent news:

12:52.270 --> 12:53.500
the time is set.

12:55.550 --> 12:56.330
In three days,

12:56.720 --> 12:58.730
the Prince of Langya will pray at Fengxiao Temple.

12:59.360 --> 13:00.120
With him

13:00.120 --> 13:01.780
only Li Xinyue and Ji Ruofeng.

13:02.480 --> 13:04.210
It's the best chance to remove him.

13:05.360 --> 13:06.370
I've heard

13:06.550 --> 13:07.690
he keeps that habit.

13:08.510 --> 13:09.810
It is a good opening.

13:10.550 --> 13:12.090
Then let's strike that day.

13:14.120 --> 13:15.570
Lead the Hawkeye unit

13:15.960 --> 13:17.020
and hold the Shadow Prison.

13:17.630 --> 13:19.330
Until Blood River finishes,

13:20.120 --> 13:21.780
no one approaches...

13:25.200 --> 13:26.420
including me.

13:28.720 --> 13:29.690
Including you?

13:30.320 --> 13:30.730
Yes,

13:31.790 --> 13:33.140
including me.

13:34.790 --> 13:35.380
Sir,

13:36.510 --> 13:37.420
you suspect them?

13:40.000 --> 13:41.300
Just a precaution.

13:41.790 --> 13:43.180
Su Changhe's been

13:43.510 --> 13:45.140
far too cooperative.

13:46.270 --> 13:48.090
It unsettles me.

13:49.670 --> 13:50.170
As you command!

13:50.170 --> 13:51.020
- As you command! - As you command!

13:57.600 --> 13:58.060
Sir,

13:58.630 --> 13:59.450
this is a gamble.

14:02.550 --> 14:03.450
It is.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.500
So this time I'm betting

14:07.630 --> 14:09.090
His Majesty

14:09.910 --> 14:12.850
also wants the Prince of Langya dead!

14:13.910 --> 14:15.060
They're brothers,

14:15.150 --> 14:16.090
and the throne

14:16.750 --> 14:17.450
was even ceded to him

14:17.750 --> 14:19.540
by the Prince of Langya.

14:23.120 --> 14:24.090
Precisely because

14:24.960 --> 14:28.730
that throne was given by him.

14:30.870 --> 14:31.660
Three days later,

14:32.000 --> 14:32.810
at Fengxiao Temple...

14:33.670 --> 14:35.330
Day to day you'd never guess

14:35.440 --> 14:36.850
the Prince of Langya is that devout.

14:39.270 --> 14:41.780
He isn't going there to worship.

14:45.000 --> 14:47.450
He's going to meet someone.

14:53.000 --> 14:53.930
How many came?

14:55.720 --> 14:57.020
Uncle Qidao brought a dozen or so.

14:57.390 --> 14:58.210
Plus Uncle Zhe,

14:58.720 --> 14:59.970
twenty elites on the surface

15:00.120 --> 15:01.140
to ambush the Prince of Langya.

15:01.910 --> 15:02.930
In the shadows,

15:03.320 --> 15:04.020
Xuewei,

15:04.320 --> 15:04.900
Changli,

15:05.120 --> 15:06.090
they're already in place.

15:06.550 --> 15:07.210
Count you and me,

15:07.600 --> 15:08.300
seven in all.

15:08.790 --> 15:09.540
The Shadow Sect

15:09.750 --> 15:10.900
has no clue.

15:11.600 --> 15:12.260
Eight in all!

15:13.440 --> 15:14.500
You're not of Blood River.

15:14.720 --> 15:15.900
This has nothing to do with you.

15:16.550 --> 15:17.970
But I'm Su Muyu's friend.

15:18.390 --> 15:20.180
He's with the Nan'an City Medicine Hall's,

15:20.240 --> 15:20.730
my partner.

15:22.600 --> 15:23.180
Fine.

15:23.790 --> 15:24.730
Then don't you die on me,

15:25.320 --> 15:26.210
or he'll blame me.

15:26.870 --> 15:28.090
I'm Su Zhe's daughter, you know.

15:28.960 --> 15:29.450
By the way,

15:30.360 --> 15:31.260
where's my father?

15:31.960 --> 15:33.090
This time,

15:33.270 --> 15:34.380
what's his assignment?

15:35.120 --> 15:36.020
His task

15:36.600 --> 15:37.660
is the most important.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.180
Someone from the Shadow Sect is here.

15:47.480 --> 15:48.180
Not Crow?

15:49.080 --> 15:50.090
Crow has other business.

15:50.480 --> 15:51.690
I am the Shadow Sect's Left Shadow Guard,

15:51.960 --> 15:52.730
Luo Tianxiang.

15:53.360 --> 15:55.930
I hear your Right Shadow Guard

15:56.080 --> 15:57.140
is the Lone Sword Deity.

15:57.360 --> 15:58.450
He has a name close to mine,

15:58.840 --> 15:59.660
both "Qingyang."

16:00.080 --> 16:01.260
Since you're the Left Shadow Guard

16:01.480 --> 16:02.090
and your surname is Luo,

16:02.390 --> 16:02.970
you must be

16:03.360 --> 16:04.090
quite formidable as well.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.420
Senior Luo's swordwork is peerless.

16:08.910 --> 16:09.930
In the Shadow Sect, for decades,

16:10.150 --> 16:11.450
only this one Sword Deity has emerged.

16:11.960 --> 16:12.970
I'm far beneath him.

16:14.550 --> 16:15.730
Then, Left Shadow Guard,

16:15.730 --> 16:16.450
what brings you

16:16.720 --> 16:17.380
here today?

16:18.320 --> 16:20.210
Crow delivered the Patriarch's message.

16:20.670 --> 16:21.420
The Sect Leader has decided:

16:21.790 --> 16:22.660
three days from now,

16:23.080 --> 16:23.810
at Fengxiao Temple,

16:24.320 --> 16:25.540
we ambush the Prince of Langya.

16:30.240 --> 16:31.540
Go tell your Sect Leader Yi Bu:

16:32.080 --> 16:32.850
within three days,

16:33.270 --> 16:34.420
we need more intel.

16:34.870 --> 16:35.780
Killing the Prince of Langya

16:36.240 --> 16:36.970
isn't something decided

16:36.970 --> 16:37.970
with a single sentence.

16:39.480 --> 16:40.210
Of course.

16:40.750 --> 16:41.380
In this fight,

16:41.720 --> 16:42.850
none of us has a way back.

16:43.320 --> 16:45.020
The Sect Leader will send Tianqi City's "shadow"

16:45.080 --> 16:45.850
to move with you.

16:46.440 --> 16:47.260
At the critical moment,

16:47.870 --> 16:49.140
he'll act himself.

17:05.350 --> 17:06.330
Sir.

17:07.720 --> 17:08.780
Elders,

17:10.000 --> 17:10.610
you're here.

17:11.750 --> 17:12.890
Looks like you've

17:13.240 --> 17:14.740
run into trouble.

17:15.510 --> 17:17.850
You summoned all three of us at once.

17:19.640 --> 17:20.370
However...

17:20.440 --> 17:21.300
I understand.

17:22.550 --> 17:24.740
You three have retired from the jianghu

17:25.270 --> 17:27.740
and don't wish to meddle in Tianqi's affairs.

17:28.110 --> 17:28.780
But,

17:28.920 --> 17:30.220
this matter is grave.

17:30.480 --> 17:31.410
We may have to mobilize

17:31.590 --> 17:33.300
over half the Shadow Sect's forces,

17:34.480 --> 17:36.300
so I ask the three of you

17:37.160 --> 17:39.170
to help guard one place.

17:42.110 --> 17:43.810
All three of us,

17:44.200 --> 17:45.940
to guard a single place?

17:46.640 --> 17:47.740
You mean

17:48.310 --> 17:49.610
the Wanjuan Tower?

17:55.160 --> 17:55.850
Yes.

17:59.830 --> 18:00.460
Master?

18:08.790 --> 18:09.500
Master.

18:18.550 --> 18:18.980
Master.

18:19.550 --> 18:20.330
Don't nod off.

18:20.640 --> 18:21.220
Master.

18:25.240 --> 18:26.090
Your Highness?

18:29.030 --> 18:31.060
Apologies.

18:32.070 --> 18:33.330
The road was long.

18:33.640 --> 18:34.740
I got a bit tired

18:35.070 --> 18:36.130
and dozed off.

18:37.110 --> 18:38.170
Master Forget-Joy

18:38.550 --> 18:39.780
and Master Forget-Worry

18:40.030 --> 18:41.330
are quite the pair.

18:46.720 --> 18:48.060
My senior

18:48.440 --> 18:49.890
is named "Forget-Worry,"

18:50.400 --> 18:51.540
yet these days

18:51.640 --> 18:53.570
he worries nonstop.

18:54.480 --> 18:56.300
I'm "Forget-Joy,"

18:56.300 --> 18:58.740
and live free and easy.

19:00.510 --> 19:02.780
Truly fate toys with us.

19:05.440 --> 19:06.650
Just now in meditation,

19:07.440 --> 19:08.650
I dreamed

19:09.240 --> 19:11.540
the Buddha spoke with me

19:11.790 --> 19:14.460
on the path of joy and sorrow.

19:17.400 --> 19:18.090
Master,

19:19.110 --> 19:20.300
we've known each other for years.

19:20.720 --> 19:21.500
Why put on the sage act

19:21.750 --> 19:23.060
in front of me?

19:24.110 --> 19:25.150
You actually dreamed

19:25.200 --> 19:26.940
of Tianxiang Restaurant's

19:26.960 --> 19:27.740
All-Vegetable Banquet,

19:28.030 --> 19:28.980
from dawn

19:29.200 --> 19:30.710
all the way to sunset.

19:32.070 --> 19:33.260
How did you know?

19:34.070 --> 19:34.740
You drool

19:35.510 --> 19:36.260
was dripping.

19:39.400 --> 19:40.500
Amitabha.

19:40.790 --> 19:42.460
My fault.

19:44.680 --> 19:45.260
Master,

19:46.440 --> 19:47.410
how are Master Forget-Worry

19:47.790 --> 19:48.890
and the boy lately?

19:49.960 --> 19:50.890
Are they doing well?

19:52.110 --> 19:53.370
That child,

19:53.750 --> 19:56.130
like his father Ye Dingzhi,

19:56.590 --> 19:59.260
is a martial genius.

20:01.920 --> 20:02.700
Thank you.

20:04.440 --> 20:05.460
I'd rather

20:06.070 --> 20:07.220
he be ordinary.

20:08.160 --> 20:09.060
The stronger he is,

20:09.830 --> 20:10.810
the greater the risk.

20:19.030 --> 20:20.020
Mr. Su,

20:21.510 --> 20:23.130
I thought the last time we met

20:24.000 --> 20:24.650
would be

20:24.680 --> 20:26.020
our final meeting.

20:26.960 --> 20:28.370
So did I.

20:29.200 --> 20:30.020
Then,

20:30.510 --> 20:32.330
what changed your mind?

20:34.480 --> 20:36.060
That cursed thing called fate.

20:37.510 --> 20:39.330
The Demon-Taming Staff.

20:41.240 --> 20:42.810
Sharp eye, Master.

20:43.640 --> 20:44.940
It is the Demon-Taming Staff.

20:46.200 --> 20:50.090
I'm the demon in your heart, Su Zhe.

20:52.110 --> 20:53.330
I'm here to help Your Highness

20:53.830 --> 20:55.130
cast it out.

21:13.640 --> 21:14.610
Who are those bandits

21:14.920 --> 21:16.610
to dare assassinate the Prince of Langya?

21:17.000 --> 21:17.850
If you ask me,

21:17.880 --> 21:19.780
[Ji Ruofeng, Guardian White Tiger]
they're likely acquaintances.

21:21.200 --> 21:21.700
Blood River,

21:22.270 --> 21:23.060
show yourselves!

21:32.920 --> 21:33.500
Kill!

21:45.440 --> 21:46.260
What's this?

21:46.350 --> 21:47.410
So few men?

21:48.110 --> 21:48.890
Why didn't your squad

21:49.030 --> 21:49.980
bring more along?

21:50.400 --> 21:51.510
The Patriarch was badly wounded

21:51.510 --> 21:52.930
in the last attempt

21:52.930 --> 21:54.020
on the Prince of Langya.

21:54.720 --> 21:56.700
We must keep enough hands

21:57.000 --> 21:58.410
to guard him!

22:02.510 --> 22:03.300
You knew

22:03.830 --> 22:04.600
I'd come here

22:04.600 --> 22:05.850
with few guards,

22:06.270 --> 22:07.350
so you thought

22:07.590 --> 22:09.410
it was the perfect time to kill me.

22:09.880 --> 22:11.940
We never believed we could kill you.

22:12.510 --> 22:14.090
The price is too high.

22:14.720 --> 22:15.940
Blood River can't afford it.

22:16.640 --> 22:17.500
Then why

22:17.920 --> 22:19.700
are we meeting here?

22:20.270 --> 22:21.700
Didn't I just say?

22:22.240 --> 22:23.780
Blame it on cursed fate.

22:33.350 --> 22:34.980
Amitabha...

22:36.960 --> 22:38.570
My Prajna Bell

22:38.920 --> 22:40.410
isn't as good as my senior's.

22:41.030 --> 22:41.740
Your Highness...

22:42.550 --> 22:43.700
my inner force

22:44.110 --> 22:45.570
is spent.

22:46.350 --> 22:48.300
If blood is shed at Fengxiao Temple,

22:49.550 --> 22:51.370
the blame is mine.

23:05.640 --> 23:06.720
Let me witness

23:06.720 --> 23:09.650
the fabled Realm-Rending Sword Art.

23:09.920 --> 23:11.300
Heaven-Demon Sixteen Dances!

23:21.750 --> 23:23.300
Few have ever seen

23:23.640 --> 23:25.540
the true Demon dance.

23:25.920 --> 23:26.700
Those who did

23:26.960 --> 23:28.060
are already dead.

23:28.830 --> 23:30.940
You might survive,

23:31.350 --> 23:32.370
but this Demon

23:33.000 --> 23:34.410
will walk with you forever!

23:39.270 --> 23:39.740
Hold on.

23:39.960 --> 23:40.650
I'm calling for reinforcements.

23:41.070 --> 23:41.540
Got it!

24:11.960 --> 24:13.460
"Stage a fine play with me.

24:14.270 --> 24:16.090
Draw the Shadow Sect away,

24:16.790 --> 24:18.220
and level the Wanjuan Tower.

24:19.000 --> 24:19.980
By Muyu"

24:23.480 --> 24:24.540
All right.

24:26.070 --> 24:27.650
I'm heading to Tianqi City now

24:28.030 --> 24:29.810
to see how "fine" this play really is.

24:39.550 --> 24:40.170
Come in.

24:45.240 --> 24:46.330
Uncle Zhe has struck.

24:46.680 --> 24:47.500
At Fengxiao Temple,

24:47.830 --> 24:48.650
the killing's begun.

24:49.200 --> 24:49.890
Uncle Zhe said

24:50.400 --> 24:51.940
it'll shake the heavens and earth.

24:52.240 --> 24:52.940
He guarantees it.

24:53.510 --> 24:54.850
Send the heaven-rank killing order.

24:56.000 --> 24:56.850
Time the real blade

24:57.640 --> 24:58.740
showed itself.

24:59.000 --> 24:59.740
I have waited

25:01.440 --> 25:02.060
for this day

25:02.060 --> 25:03.090
a long time.

25:05.510 --> 25:06.740
Fight, then go home.

25:07.200 --> 25:08.370
Tianqi City bores you?

25:09.680 --> 25:10.740
I'd bet even Su Muyu,

25:10.790 --> 25:12.260
locked in the Shadow Prison,

25:12.640 --> 25:14.410
finds it interesting.

25:15.590 --> 25:16.330
Dull, actually.

25:17.640 --> 25:18.740
Always feels like

25:18.960 --> 25:20.460
a string is pulling me.

25:21.270 --> 25:22.170
And today,

25:23.830 --> 25:25.610
we'll cut that string.

25:26.310 --> 25:28.060
A fresh-carved peachwood sword?

25:29.110 --> 25:30.220
It's blessed at Mount Wangcheng.

25:32.000 --> 25:33.780
You like playing the diviner that much?

25:34.830 --> 25:37.330
I even dreamed of soaring off

25:38.200 --> 25:39.460
as an immortal.

25:53.240 --> 25:53.700
Sir.

25:54.680 --> 25:55.460
Su Zhe and Xie Qidao

25:55.550 --> 25:56.500
led killers to ambush Xiao Ruofeng

25:56.590 --> 25:58.130
at Fengxiao Temple.

25:58.440 --> 25:59.170
But it seems

25:59.240 --> 26:00.500
they can't best the prince's men.

26:00.920 --> 26:01.330
We received

26:01.590 --> 26:03.130
our men's distress signal.

26:03.830 --> 26:05.740
Send more to Fengxiao Temple.

26:07.680 --> 26:08.980
Dispatch the Shadow Guards

26:09.240 --> 26:09.810
from the Wanjuan Tower too.

26:10.640 --> 26:11.700
No more standing by.

26:12.200 --> 26:12.890
Move in!

26:12.890 --> 26:14.300
What... what if we're exposed?

26:14.830 --> 26:16.060
If he dies,

26:17.270 --> 26:18.850
the one commanding Tianqi's defenses

26:19.000 --> 26:20.170
won't be him anymore.

26:20.680 --> 26:21.570
What's to fear?

26:22.000 --> 26:22.410
Got it.

26:37.160 --> 26:37.740
Young miracle physician.

26:38.310 --> 26:39.020
Who knew

26:39.640 --> 26:40.500
we'd meet again?

26:41.680 --> 26:43.220
I'm glad to see you again,

26:43.400 --> 26:44.410
Beauty Mu.

26:49.960 --> 26:50.370
Here.

26:59.920 --> 27:00.940
Will this little thing

27:01.270 --> 27:02.700
find Su Muyu shortly?

27:02.830 --> 27:04.570
That depends on the tacit bond between Muyu and me.

27:05.240 --> 27:05.940
After all,

27:07.550 --> 27:09.300
we've cheated death together so many times.

27:10.110 --> 27:11.170
If there's no bond,

27:11.550 --> 27:12.410
then everything

27:12.510 --> 27:13.540
falls apart.

27:17.030 --> 27:17.980
If our bond

27:17.980 --> 27:18.810
is proven,

27:19.030 --> 27:20.410
will you start overthinking it?

27:21.240 --> 27:22.410
Beauty Mu,

27:22.510 --> 27:23.810
why tease me

27:23.920 --> 27:24.650
like the Patriarch?

27:25.790 --> 27:26.410
We're not

27:26.510 --> 27:27.700
what you think.

27:28.680 --> 27:29.260
I understand.

27:29.790 --> 27:30.540
Just friends.

27:30.960 --> 27:31.740
Good friends.

27:39.310 --> 27:40.220
Sir!

27:45.510 --> 27:46.020
Sir.

27:49.400 --> 27:50.570
Any trouble here?

27:51.310 --> 27:52.300
No trouble.

27:52.590 --> 27:53.540
Rest easy, Sir.

27:54.440 --> 27:55.090
Good.

27:56.590 --> 27:57.610
You did well.

27:59.400 --> 28:00.570
Thank you for the praise.

28:01.200 --> 28:01.890
All right.

28:07.680 --> 28:08.170
Sir.

28:09.720 --> 28:10.330
What are you doing?

28:10.920 --> 28:11.540
What,

28:12.400 --> 28:13.940
can't I enter either?

28:14.640 --> 28:15.700
I wouldn't...

28:16.480 --> 28:17.060
dare stop you!

28:23.830 --> 28:24.460
How dare you!

28:26.270 --> 28:27.060
Drop the act.

28:33.510 --> 28:34.650
How did you know?

28:34.830 --> 28:36.540
The Sect Leader and I made an agreement:

28:37.070 --> 28:38.090
even he

28:38.400 --> 28:39.700
can't enter the Shadow Prison.

28:40.310 --> 28:41.610
If he truly had to

28:41.640 --> 28:42.610
he'd first remind me

28:43.110 --> 28:44.260
of that agreement

28:44.310 --> 28:45.460
before stepping in.

28:46.590 --> 28:47.850
But you came

28:48.240 --> 28:49.500
as if no such agreement

28:49.510 --> 28:50.540
existed.

28:51.200 --> 28:52.890
So you must be an impostor!

28:55.510 --> 28:56.610
Didn't expect

28:56.830 --> 28:57.540
Yi Bu

28:57.790 --> 28:59.130
to be clever sometimes.

28:59.510 --> 29:00.590
The Shadow Prison's guard

29:00.590 --> 29:01.740
is now the Hawkeye unit.

29:02.510 --> 29:04.370
Even we Three Officials

29:05.030 --> 29:05.920
don't have the rank

29:05.920 --> 29:07.260
to bypass them.

29:07.720 --> 29:08.810
Then I'll change my face.

29:09.400 --> 29:11.410
Yi Bu would never imagine

29:11.750 --> 29:13.540
someone bold enough

29:13.790 --> 29:14.850
to use his identity

29:15.030 --> 29:16.060
to slip inside.

29:32.200 --> 29:32.780
Traitor!

29:34.240 --> 29:36.310
I don't know what Yi Bu's thinking.

29:36.480 --> 29:37.220
Blood River's strength

29:37.220 --> 29:38.810
already dwarfs the Shadow Sect's,

29:39.310 --> 29:41.500
yet he clings to stale rules

29:41.790 --> 29:42.810
to keep Blood River in check.

29:43.590 --> 29:45.740
I'm not like my two foolish partners.

30:01.200 --> 30:02.850
You betrayed us?

30:03.680 --> 30:04.500
I told you

30:05.030 --> 30:06.460
I admire Su Changhe.

30:07.160 --> 30:08.940
After that Yellow Springs Pawnshop affair,

30:09.790 --> 30:11.780
I started contacting them.

30:12.110 --> 30:13.560
He's smarter than you all.

30:14.200 --> 30:15.570
He chooses

30:16.200 --> 30:17.610
the right side.

30:22.920 --> 30:24.460
You can't win.

30:26.200 --> 30:27.940
Ever consider this:

30:28.550 --> 30:30.540
even if Su Muyu's caught,

30:31.160 --> 30:32.000
it may just be

30:32.000 --> 30:33.940
a trap to bottle you.

30:34.550 --> 30:35.660
And the one in the jar

30:35.660 --> 30:36.740
won't be Su Muyu,

30:37.240 --> 30:37.890
but...

30:39.160 --> 30:40.240
the Shadow Sect.

30:42.070 --> 30:43.410
What do you mean?

30:45.310 --> 30:46.960
Even if we seize Su Muyu,

30:47.110 --> 30:49.230
how many men to guard him?

30:49.510 --> 30:51.260
If he breaks out,

30:51.440 --> 30:52.570
how many more

30:52.590 --> 30:53.460
to stop him?

30:54.160 --> 30:55.130
By then,

30:56.640 --> 30:58.330
the Shadow Sect is meat on the block.

31:00.440 --> 31:01.500
Enough talk.

31:05.270 --> 31:05.890
Mu Ying.

31:09.590 --> 31:10.940
Did you get his face?

31:12.270 --> 31:13.020
Not much

31:13.020 --> 31:14.410
worth remembering.

31:15.200 --> 31:16.540
About nine-tenths.

31:17.070 --> 31:17.780
Good.

31:33.960 --> 31:35.410
Then the real Heaven Official

31:36.070 --> 31:37.370
needn't exist.

31:39.310 --> 31:39.940
I...

31:41.310 --> 31:42.940
only choose the strong side.

31:50.920 --> 31:51.780
What's this array?

31:52.350 --> 31:53.570
The Dipper Array.

31:54.240 --> 31:56.170
Its killing power is average.

31:56.550 --> 31:57.890
But at trapping,

31:58.240 --> 32:00.740
it's among the best under heaven.

32:01.350 --> 32:02.220
If you've got the skill,

32:03.000 --> 32:04.170
break it!

32:13.960 --> 32:15.650
Looks like they're exposed.

32:41.550 --> 32:42.780
Pretty nasty.

33:00.070 --> 33:01.370
My one drop of antidote

33:01.640 --> 33:03.410
won't clear all the Drunken Dream Bone.

33:03.680 --> 33:04.330
Ms. Yumo,

33:04.440 --> 33:05.940
got any more tracking spiders?

33:08.550 --> 33:09.810
This one's unique to Muyu.

33:10.240 --> 33:11.370
It takes a long time

33:11.680 --> 33:12.980
to raise one like it.

33:13.880 --> 33:14.500
Still,

33:15.830 --> 33:16.740
It's Muyu.

33:17.110 --> 33:18.460
Even with a single drop,

33:19.030 --> 33:19.740
he'll find a way

33:20.680 --> 33:22.090
to crack it.

33:23.440 --> 33:23.940
True.

33:24.160 --> 33:25.090
He is Su Muyu.

33:27.270 --> 33:29.460
As if a sword fell from the sky...

33:29.460 --> 33:32.270
[As if a sword fell from the sky]

33:32.270 --> 33:32.740
Yue'an,

33:33.200 --> 33:33.810
live on.

33:34.310 --> 33:35.610
When you grow into a Sword Deity,

33:35.960 --> 33:37.170
revive our No-Sword City.

33:37.350 --> 33:39.500
[The mist breaks, gone for good]

33:42.400 --> 33:44.300
How strong can one sword become?

33:44.960 --> 33:46.020
First it strikes down ten,

33:46.270 --> 33:47.370
then a hundred,

33:47.830 --> 33:48.980
then a thousand,

33:49.350 --> 33:50.410
even ten thousand!

33:51.660 --> 33:53.270
[As if a sword fell from the sky]

33:53.270 --> 33:54.880
[The mist breaks, gone for good]

33:54.880 --> 33:57.020
I gaze at the world's endless grief,

34:03.590 --> 34:05.060
Look again...

34:09.360 --> 34:10.900
the moon hangs high.

34:13.340 --> 34:14.940
[As if a sword fell from the sky]

34:14.940 --> 34:16.540
[The mist breaks, gone for good.]

34:16.540 --> 34:18.140
[I gaze at the world's endless grief]

34:18.140 --> 34:19.840
[Look again, the moon hangs high.]

34:19.840 --> 34:20.500
Father,

34:21.760 --> 34:24.170
lend me your righteous sword energy tonight.

34:35.400 --> 34:35.940
Break!

34:40.620 --> 34:44.100
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

34:44.140 --> 34:48.020
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

34:49.860 --> 34:53.340
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

34:53.380 --> 34:57.220
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

34:59.220 --> 35:02.500
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

35:02.620 --> 35:04.700
♪Still I can't let go♪

35:04.860 --> 35:08.300
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

35:08.780 --> 35:10.980
♪My heart no longer my own♪

35:11.100 --> 35:16.100
♪No one can escape from love♪

35:32.700 --> 35:36.420
♪How many hidden feelings♪

35:36.540 --> 35:40.620
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

35:41.860 --> 35:45.740
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

35:45.860 --> 35:50.100
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

35:51.220 --> 35:54.100
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

35:54.180 --> 35:58.420
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

36:00.700 --> 36:04.700
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

36:04.740 --> 36:08.180
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

36:09.700 --> 36:13.140
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

36:13.220 --> 36:17.020
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

36:18.940 --> 36:22.380
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

36:22.420 --> 36:26.260
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

